# Last.fm Scrobbler for YouTube — v4.0.0

## About this release

This is an independently maintained continuation of the original **Last.fm Scrobbler for Web Services** project.

The original project is released under the **Mozilla Public License, Version 2.0 (MPL-2.0)**. The original license and notices are retained in this distribution.

This v4.0.0 release contains substantial changes and additions, including YouTube Music support, rebuilt Last.fm authentication and scrobbling, automatic reconnection after initial authorization, a compact Last.fm account/profile link in the scrobbler panel, improved setup and error handling, and a direct Last.fm API account creation link in the extension settings. Long artist and track names also scroll within the compact panel when they do not fit.

This project is **not an official release or endorsement by the original author/publisher**.

## License

This project remains available under the Mozilla Public License, Version 2.0. The complete license text is included in `LICENSE`.

---

# Changelog

## Version 4.0.0

Major release. Added full YouTube Music support, rebuilt Last.fm authentication and scrobbling, automatic Last.fm reconnection after the initial authorization, a compact connected-account link that opens the user's Last.fm profile, improved setup and error handling, a direct Last.fm API account creation link in the extension settings, and compact-panel scrolling for long artist and track names.

## Version 0.5.2

Added a direct link to the Last.fm API account creation page from the extension settings.

## Version 0.5.1

Added automatic Last.fm connection using the saved session. After the initial Last.fm authorization, the extension restores and validates the saved session automatically instead of requiring the Last.fm confirmation page each time.

## Version 0.5.0

Fixed Last.fm scrobbling, including timestamp formatting and related request handling.

## Version 0.4.9

Restored Last.fm scrobble requests using the required POST/form-encoded request format and improved session-key handling.

## Version 0.4.8

Moved Last.fm API requests through the extension service worker to avoid API request problems encountered from the YouTube Music panel.

## Version 0.4.7

Improved Last.fm setup when API credentials are missing. The extension now directs the user to the extension settings instead of requiring the setup location to be discovered manually.

## Version 0.4.6

Improved Last.fm API request handling and exposed clearer Last.fm API errors during authentication.

## Version 0.4.5

Moved Last.fm API credential retrieval to the service worker.

## Version 0.4.4

Fixed the Last.fm authorization-tab message handling so the authorization page can be opened correctly.

## Version 0.3.9

Made the YouTube Music connection controls visible and removed the redundant `redirect_uri` parameter from Last.fm authorization.

## Version 0.3.6

Fixed YouTube Music panel colors by removing an inherited invert filter.

## Version 0.3.4

Floated the YouTube Music Last.fm panel above the player bar to prevent the UI from collapsing into a tiny sliver.

## Version 0.3.2

- Fixed the Last.fm authentication retry typo.
- Improved Last.fm authentication error handling.
- Improved YouTube/YouTube Music player detection retries.
- Added visible detection diagnostics for artist, track, and duration.
- Improved chapter-change detection.
- Removed the unused `management` API dependency from the MV3 service worker.


### v4.0.1 test update
- Sends album and duration with Last.fm Now Playing updates when Last.fm provides the metadata.
- Exposes normalized album metadata to the companion Now Playing feed.
